        <rule name="Less Than Equal" id="4ea4-867c-83e6-12ed" hidden="false">
          <description>Some ships in the fleet are noted as being &apos;less than equal&apos;, this means they have normal leadership, so 6-9 Leadership instead of 8-10, a +1 Boarding modifier instead of +2, and boarding torpedoes, but no Space Marine benefit against or for Hit and Run attacks.</description>
        </rule>
