          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effects" typeId="fe13-6bab-c5cb-4f1d">Repulsor Shields: Ignore all negative effects of having a blast marker or gas clouds in contact with the ship’s base as it applies to leadership, movement and repairing critical damage. This effect goes away if the ship suffers “Shields Collapsed” critical damage.

Augmented Weapon Relays: Weapon batteries shift left on the gunnery table before all other modifiers are applied. Lance hits count double on rolls of a 6.
Can take no other refits*

cannot take any other refits</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
